{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T05:42:15.463Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9d7f970542d8df5a0a6bdb3b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1713+pm-gh1719+pm-o74zyh","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T05:42:15.463Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-14T05:42:15.462Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Review round 1 (Greptile P1, Codex P2/P3), fixed: (1) The merge driver merges deferred_fields by field, not by whole-element identity. A one-sided addition survives, a deletion (resolution) wins, and a reason both sides changed differently resolves by stable value order in either merge direction. Two branches with different reasons for one field previously produced a document the parser refuses (duplicate field). (2) Explicit --deadline/--assignee/--ac/--estimate values or unsets on create --stdin-json now override the document's deferral of that field instead of failing with create_deferral_conflict. (3) The error catalog attributes the create_deferral_* codes to the create command (generator module map). Specs extended in tests/unit/sdk/lifecycle/create-deferrals.spec.ts."}]}],"before_hash":"63f3aecfc8068281b314a0c5d3eae4ad76afcc068e65e6559fad7f1a491273c6","after_hash":"27460a9c687006962d766992ba72840c972603ed3842b620ff057e284df84b93","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"630f6e828f4f2f8ce0a5f3530518a6cca7c9f0e248ede266557db85c8e913944"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T06:10:56.045Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9d7f970542d8df5a0a6bdb3b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-chdp87","claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-chdp87","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-chdp87+pm-gh1713+pm-gh1719+pm-o74zyh","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-chdp87","claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-chdp87","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-14T06:10:56.045Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Review round 2 (Codex), fixed: (1) On a strict tracker, rolling back a deferred create was refused twice over. The compensation close went through strict close validation, and a create that used the --clear-* options hid the transaction's apply marker behind its ' | explicit_unset=...' suffix (filed and fixed as pm-chdp87). Compensation closes now pass validateClose off, since a rollback close completes no work. (2) After the field-keyed union, the merge driver prunes any deferral whose field holds a concrete merged value, in the item merge and the history-union projection alike. (3) A runtime schema field whose metadata key is a deferrable field (due mapped to deadline) now conflicts with a deferral of that field, both in create and in the stdin-json override. (4) The close refusal's pm update recovery carries --author=<the close's author>, so strict ownership accepts the corrective update. Negative control: without the compensation fix, the strict rollback spec fails."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T06:10:56.045Z"}],"before_hash":"27460a9c687006962d766992ba72840c972603ed3842b620ff057e284df84b93","after_hash":"fe3865aa1d10900dfdd210d7d4d27f12e98d63225719e9fef1dc6727c1d51f4f","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"932ff84dbfb27e36f619a764d29c362126ecaee5c98926198298af7af2f59597"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T06:10:56.986Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9d7f970542d8df5a0a6bdb3b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-chdp87","claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-chdp87","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-chdp87+pm-gh1713+pm-gh1719+pm-o74zyh","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-chdp87","claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-chdp87","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies/2","value":{"id":"pm-chdp87","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-14T06:10:56.712Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:update:dep","author_source":"detected"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T06:10:56.986Z"}],"before_hash":"fe3865aa1d10900dfdd210d7d4d27f12e98d63225719e9fef1dc6727c1d51f4f","after_hash":"5da843c315b1501c5a6df554ae019810895c0d3cdb0b4895919ad36569eaacb4","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"maintenance","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"8c502d7ffb95ec8e09bf08606195c5ba29936f670f2c27f9ab7c24e3eac559cf"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T06:34:03.946Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9d7f970542d8df5a0a6bdb3b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-chdp87","claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-chdp87","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-chdp87+pm-gh1713+pm-gh1719+pm-o74zyh","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-chdp87","claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-chdp87","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-14T06:34:03.946Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Review round 3 (Codex, Greptile, CodeRabbit). Four findings fixed: (1) commitImportedItem prunes deferrals that the imported document resolves before stamping, guards and persistence, matching the item-store write path. (2) On stdin-json create, an --unset of a schema field mapped to a deferrable key (due, its cli flag, or an alias) drops the document deferral of that key. (3) A deferral drops template defaults of schema fields mapped to that key. A caller's explicit value is kept, so the conflict check still fires. (4) The close refusal's recovery carries --force alongside --author. Kept by design: an explicit --defer-reason supplied together with a document's reasonless deferral applies to it, because the caller's own reason is explicit and auditable. The round-2 fix was about one document entry silently borrowing another entry's reason."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T06:34:03.946Z"}],"before_hash":"5da843c315b1501c5a6df554ae019810895c0d3cdb0b4895919ad36569eaacb4","after_hash":"13935b7f1b815b0343ddb24f15a3df6aed09e292bf7fbae395e3db3701b2af54","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"4bb80001ce3d6237edc95ac5153e3bfec3dcfeff6c48d792aed3394ea52158a4"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T06:50:10.363Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9d7f970542d8df5a0a6bdb3b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-chdp87","claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-chdp87","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-chdp87+pm-gh1713+pm-gh1719+pm-o74zyh","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-chdp87","claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-chdp87","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-14T06:50:10.362Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Review round 4 (Codex), fixed: (1) A schema field with required_on_create whose metadata key is a deferrable field (due mapped to deadline) is now satisfied by a deferral of that key, as the type-level requirement is (withoutDeferredRuntimeRequirements). (2) On stdin-json create, an explicit reason in any spelling (deferReason or the defer_reason alias) is never replaced by a reason synthesized from the document."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T06:50:10.363Z"}],"before_hash":"13935b7f1b815b0343ddb24f15a3df6aed09e292bf7fbae395e3db3701b2af54","after_hash":"0407d1900ea0dfe5f413008fcbdef984838b17e0850dcfec58936417e29a5ea2","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"6b668748dad5c2d119a956928471f751061931512b05f397bad103e136889b89"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T07:00:49.515Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9d7f970542d8df5a0a6bdb3b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-chdp87","claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-chdp87","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-chdp87+pm-gh1713+pm-gh1719+pm-o74zyh","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-chdp87","claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-chdp87","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-14T07:00:49.515Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Review round 5 (Codex P1), fixed: the round-4 relaxation also suppressed schema fields with required: true. Those require the value on every stored record, so the item would persist and then fail item_document_invalid on the next read. Only create-only required_on_create requirements now yield to a deferral; a stored-record requirement keeps refusing the create. Covered by spec."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T07:00:49.515Z"}],"before_hash":"0407d1900ea0dfe5f413008fcbdef984838b17e0850dcfec58936417e29a5ea2","after_hash":"e81c52c32cac3ee47ffe1dcc8133db44f097cb536415bed999a01caf8adccda6","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version"